{"name":"Two alcove wardrobes, one around the boiler, East Finchley (standard sizes)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (9 Oct 2026) from the job photos at standard sizes (nothing measured): both wardrobes 950 wide (filling the alcoves either side of a 1500 x 380 chimney breast), 600 deep and 2450 high under a 2700 ceiling, 18 mm MDF with 18 mm backs, recessed plinth behind the doors, 100 mm rail over the doors. Two doors each, 472 wide with 3 mm gaps, with applied moulding making a tall upper and a shorter lower panel. Left: hanging rail with two shelves above. Right: a divider with eight narrow shelves on the left, and on the right a shelf under the boiler, with room round it. Walls, chimney breast and boiler are room context. No dimension lines. Read back face by face; units mm, X along the wall, Y out from the room, Z up.","materials":{"MDF 18 mm":{"color":[200,172,142],"roughness":0.85},"Rail":{"color":[190,193,197],"roughness":0.35,"metalness":0.7},"Moulding":{"color":[226,204,170],"roughness":0.8},"Wall":{"color":[236,234,228],"roughness":0.95},"Room: boiler":{"color":[244,244,242],"roughness":0.4}},"moves":{"Hanging wardrobe: Door, left (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[1.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":90},"at":[0.0,0.7],"with":["Hanging wardrobe: Door, left (hinged left): moulding, upper","Hanging wardrobe: Door, left (hinged left): moulding, lower"]},"Hanging wardrobe: Door, right (hinged right)":{"hinge":{"origin":[948.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,1],"angle":100},"at":[0.06,0.76],"with":["Hanging wardrobe: Door, right (hinged right): moulding, upper","Hanging wardrobe: Door, right (hinged right): moulding, lower"]},"Boiler wardrobe: Door, left (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[2451.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":100},"at":[0.12,0.82],"with":["Boiler wardrobe: Door, left (hinged left): moulding, upper","Boiler wardrobe: Door, left (hinged left): moulding, lower"]},"Boiler wardrobe: Door, right (hinged right)":{"hinge":{"origin":[33